            </h2>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">

                    Educate First

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">

                    We believe informed customers make better long-term
                    decisions.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">

                    Quality Always

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">

                    We choose reliable equipment backed by proven performance
                    and strong manufacturer warranties.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">

                    Honest Advice

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">

                    Recommendations are based on your needs, never on selling
                    the largest system.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">

                    Long-Term Support

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-600">

                    Our commitment continues long after your installation has
                    been completed.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>
<!-- ========================================================= -->
<!-- Why Choose Solar8                                         -->
<!-- ========================================================= -->

<section class="bg-slate-950 py-24 text-white">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

            <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange-400">

                WHY SOLAR8

            </span>

            <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold">

                Why Customers Trust Solar8

            </h2>

            <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-9 text-slate-300">

                Choosing a solar installer is just as important as choosing the
                equipment itself. Our focus is on delivering solutions that
                perform reliably for years while providing honest advice every
                step of the way.

            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500">

                    ✓

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Professional Design

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">

                    Every solar system is designed around your electricity
                    usage, roof space and future energy requirements.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500">

                    ✓

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Premium Equipment

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">

                    We recommend trusted manufacturers known for performance,
                    reliability and long-term support.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500">

                    ✓

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Expert Installation

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">

                    Professional workmanship, compliant installations and
                    attention to detail on every project.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500">

                    ✓

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Ongoing Support

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">

                    We're available long after installation to help with
                    upgrades, support and future expansion.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- ========================================================= -->
<!-- Installation Process                                      -->
<!-- ========================================================= -->

<section class="bg-white py-24">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

            <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange-500">

                OUR PROCESS

            </span>

            <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">

                From Assessment to Installation

            </h2>

            <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-9 text-slate-600">

                We've simplified the solar journey into a clear, transparent
                process so you'll always know what comes next.

            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-20 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-5">

            <div class="text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-3xl font-bold text-white">

                    1

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Assessment

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-7">

                    Understand your electricity usage and goals.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-3xl font-bold text-white">

                    2

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    System Design

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-7">

                    A tailored recommendation designed around your property.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-3xl font-bold text-white">

                    3

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Quotation

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-7">

                    Transparent pricing with no hidden surprises.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-3xl font-bold text-white">

                    4

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Installation

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-7">

                    Professional installation by experienced technicians.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-3xl font-bold text-white">

                    5

                </div>

                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">

                    Support

                </h3>

                <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-7">

                    Long-term assistance throughout the life of your system.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- ========================================================= -->
<!-- Warranty Promise                                          -->
<!-- ========================================================= -->

<section class="bg-orange-500 py-24 text-white">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 text-center">

        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange-100">

            OUR PROMISE

        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold">

            Built for Long-Term Confidence

        </h2>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-orange-100">

            We partner with reputable manufacturers and back our workmanship
            because we believe your investment should continue delivering value
            for many years to come.

        </p>

        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-8 backdrop-blur">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

                    25

                </div>

                <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">

                    Year Panel Warranty*

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-8 backdrop-blur">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

                    10

                </div>

                <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">

                    Year Battery Warranty*

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-8 backdrop-blur">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

                    5

                </div>

                <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">

                    Year Inverter Warranty*

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-8 backdrop-blur">

                <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

                    5

                </div>

                <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">

                    Year Workmanship Warranty

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>
<!-- ========================================================= -->
<!-- Final Call To Action                                      -->
<!-- ========================================================= -->

<section class="bg-slate-950 py-24 text-white">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 text-center">

        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange-400">

            READY TO GET STARTED?

        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight">

            Let's Find the Right Solar Solution
            <br />
            for Your Property

        </h2>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-300">

            Whether you're looking for reliable backup power, lower monthly
            electricity bills or complete energy independence, we'll help you
            choose a system that's designed around your needs—not a generic
            package.

        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">

            <a
                href="/assessment"
                class="rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-10 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-orange-600 hover:shadow-2xl"
            >
                {company.cta.primary}
            </a>

            <a
                href="/contact"
                class="rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-10 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:border-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300"
            >
                Contact Solar8
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- ========================================================= -->
<!-- Closing Footer                                             -->
<!-- ========================================================= -->

<Footer />

</BaseLayout>